      en: ["Constructed in 1348 by the Genoese colony.", "The tower stands approximately 67 meters high.", "Originally called the 'Tower of Christ'.", "Used as a dungeon during the 16th century.", "Famed as the starting point of Hezarfen's cross-strait flight.", "Provides a 360-degree panoramic view of Istanbul."],
